{% comment %}
 下载按钮: 使用 file-download controller 访问指定 URL，获取真实下载链接并下载文件，支持下载进度显示
 参数：
  - entity: 实体对象
  - page
{% endcomment %}
{% if entity %}
  <button
    data-controller="file-download"
    data-file-download-url-value="{{ statics['download'] }}?slug={{ page.full_slug }}"
    data-file-download-filename-value="{{ entity.metadata.filename }}"
    data-file-download-content-type-value="{{ entity.metadata.content_type }}"
    data-action="click->file-download#download"
    class="w-full btn btn-primary btn-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white border-none rounded-lg space-x-2 hover:translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow"
  >
    <i class="ri-download-cloud-2-line"></i>
    <span class="text-sm">立即下载</span>
  </button>
{% endif %}